    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5528" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bōlētus</span></b> , i,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωλίτης</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the best kind of
				mushrooms</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 22, 22, 46, § 92</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plaut. Curc. 5, 2, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 1,
			21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 101</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Juv.
				14, 8</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">much valued by the Romans,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					3, 60</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">13,
			48</span></i>.—The emperor Claudius is said to have been
			poisoned by them, Plin. l. l.: <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 12,
				67</span></i> dub.; <i><span class="en">Suet. Claud. 44</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 5,
			147</span></i>.</div>
